                        },
                        {
                          "id": "p-step-6",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "Your trailer's suspension system helps handle road stress and load stability. Look for cracked or broken springs, uneven wear, or signs that components are shifting under load. A suspension problem may not show up immediately, but can quickly become a major issue under the weight of a full haul. Regular inspection helps keep your ride smooth and your cargo protected.",
                            "align": "left",
