                        },
                        {
                          "id": "p-step-7",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "It might seem simple, but damaged door hinges or seals can ruin an entire shipment, especially if you're hauling temperature-sensitive or weather-sensitive goods. Make sure doors open and close securely, that locks are functional, and that the gaskets are intact.",
                            "align": "left",
                            "width": "full"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "p-step-7-2",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "Inside the trailer, check that your load is properly secured and balanced. Loose or shifting cargo can be dangerous, even in normal traffic conditions.",
                            "align": "left",
                            "width": "full"
                          },
